{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30877","headline":"摅情留别幷州从事 · 马戴","name":"摅情留别幷州从事","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"浅学长自鄙，谬承贤达知。\n才希汉主召，玉任楚人疑。\n年长慙漂泊，恩深惜别离。\n秋光独鸟过，暝色一蝉悲。\n鹤发生何速，龙门上苦迟。\n雕虫羞朗鉴，干禄贵明时。\n故国诚难返，青云致未期。\n空将感激泪，一自洒临岐。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"马戴","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_30877.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_30877","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}